Package: REffect
Title: Bootstrap Confidence Bands for Nonparametric Relative Effects
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Denny", "Leandro", , "dennyleandro@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Estimates nonparametric multivariate relative effects for two
    groups using 'npmv' (nonpartest), computes percentile bootstrap confidence
    intervals for each dependent variable and group, and draws a profile plot
    of the relative effects with their bootstrap bands using 'ggplot2'.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Imports: 
    dplyr,
    ggplot2,
    npmv,
    reshape2,
    stats,
    utils
Suggests: 
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.0.0
